        { "title": "Interchange Connectivity", "content": "<p class=\"text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-2\">The Purple Line has key interchange points:</p><ul class=\"text-body-md font-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed space-y-2 list-disc pl-5\"><li>Nadaprabhu Kempegowda (Majestic) &rarr; Interchange with Green Line</li><li>Future expansions may add more connectivity</li></ul>" },
